  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:08.750" end="00:12.560" ttm:agent="v1">Your man on the road, he doin' promo</p>
      <p begin="00:12.560" end="00:16.740" ttm:agent="v1">You said, &quot;Keep our business on the low-low&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:16.740" end="00:21.800" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just tryna get you out the friend zone</p>
      <p begin="00:21.800" end="00:25.380" ttm:agent="v1">Cause you look even better than the photos</p>
      <p begin="00:25.380" end="00:29.540" ttm:agent="v1">I can't find your house, send me the info</p>
      <p begin="00:29.540" end="00:33.820" ttm:agent="v1">Drivin' through the gated residential</p>
      <p begin="00:33.820" end="00:38.600" ttm:agent="v1">Found out I was comin', sent your friends home</p>
      <p begin="00:38.600" end="00:42.700" ttm:agent="v1">Keep on tryna hide it but your friends know</p>
      <p begin="00:42.700" end="00:46.420" ttm:agent="v1">I only call you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="00:46.420" end="00:51.250" ttm:agent="v1">The only time that I'll be by your side</p>
      <p begin="00:51.250" end="00:54.720" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="00:54.720" end="00:56.850" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm **** up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="00:56.850" end="00:59.620" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm **** up, that's the real me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:59.620" end="01:03.500" ttm:agent="v1">I only call you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="01:03.500" end="01:08.200" ttm:agent="v1">The only time I'd ever call you mine</p>
      <p begin="01:08.200" end="01:11.690" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="01:11.690" end="01:13.800" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.800" end="01:18.390" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me, babe</p>
      <p begin="01:18.390" end="01:22.830" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma let you know and keep it simple</p>
      <p begin="01:22.830" end="01:27.140" ttm:agent="v1">Tryna keep it up don't seem so simple</p>
      <p begin="01:27.140" end="01:31.250" ttm:agent="v1">I just ****ed two b*****s 'fore I saw you</p>
      <p begin="01:31.250" end="01:35.490" ttm:agent="v1">And you gon' have to do it at my tempo</p>
      <p begin="01:35.490" end="01:39.710" ttm:agent="v1">Always tryna send me off to rehab</p>
      <p begin="01:39.710" end="01:43.990" ttm:agent="v1">Drugs started feelin' like it's decaf</p>
      <p begin="01:43.990" end="01:47.910" ttm:agent="v1">I'm just tryna live life for the moment</p>
      <p begin="01:47.910" end="01:53.130" ttm:agent="v1">And all these mother****ers want a relapse</p>
      <p begin="01:53.130" end="01:57.500" ttm:agent="v1">I only call you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="01:57.500" end="02:01.230" ttm:agent="v1">The only time that I'll be by your side</p>
      <p begin="02:01.230" end="02:04.980" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="02:04.980" end="02:06.790" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="02:06.790" end="02:09.730" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:09.730" end="02:13.420" ttm:agent="v1">I only call you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="02:13.420" end="02:18.800" ttm:agent="v1">The only time I'd ever call you mine</p>
      <p begin="02:18.800" end="02:21.880" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="02:21.880" end="02:23.980" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="02:23.980" end="02:29.440" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me, babe</p>
      <p begin="02:29.440" end="02:36.500" ttm:agent="v1">Hills have eyes, the hills have eyes</p>
      <p begin="02:36.500" end="02:44.500" ttm:agent="v1">Who are you to judge, who are you to judge?</p>
      <p begin="02:46.510" end="02:53.680" ttm:agent="v1">Hide your lies, girl, hide your lies</p>
      <p begin="02:53.680" end="03:00.820" ttm:agent="v1">Only you to trust, only you</p>
      <p begin="03:00.820" end="03:04.630" ttm:agent="v1">I only call you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="03:04.630" end="03:09.700" ttm:agent="v1">The only time that I'll be by your side</p>
      <p begin="03:09.700" end="03:12.760" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="03:12.760" end="03:14.810" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="03:14.810" end="03:17.520" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me, yeah</p>
      <p begin="03:17.520" end="03:21.890" ttm:agent="v1">I only **** you when it's half past five</p>
      <p begin="03:21.890" end="03:26.800" ttm:agent="v1">The only time I'd ever call you mine</p>
      <p begin="03:26.800" end="03:29.780" ttm:agent="v1">I only love it when you touch me, not feel me</p>
      <p begin="03:29.780" end="03:31.820" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me</p>
      <p begin="03:31.820" end="03:36.520" ttm:agent="v1">When I'm ****ed up, that's the real me, babe</p>
      <p begin="03:36.520" end="03:39.490" ttm:agent="v1">Ewedihalehu</p>
      <p begin="03:39.490" end="03:44.450" ttm:agent="v1">Yene konjo, ewedihalehu</p>
      <p begin="03:44.450" end="03:48.780" ttm:agent="v1">Yene fikir, fikir, fikir, fikir</p>
